    "description": "Mentalist Base 5.4 - Mind Speech. Spells for mental telepathy with other spell casters or any being, preparing to receive such contact, and broadcasting thoughts to a wide area. Special Notes: Except where communication is noted as being only \"one-way,\" the spells above create a \"two-way\" communication between the target (and the caster). The caster is not required to speak verbally. The target speaks verbally, but the caster is actually reading the thoughts of the target (though some targets may learn to use mental communication—any caster who knows this list is presumed to have this ability).",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Mentalist Tongue *",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": true,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "caster+1 tgt",
          "duration": "C",
          "range": "100'",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "m",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster may mentally speak with another spell caster of the Mentalism realm."
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "02. Prepare Mind I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
