          "skillName": "",
          "description": "When this spell is cast, the next Mind Tongue spell (cast within one minute of this spell) will be able to focus in on a specific person as its target. The person must be Mind Stored (see the Presence spell list). This spell allows certain spells to work even if the caster doesn't know the target's exact location."
